<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Heihachi Hellsweep tekken 8</Major>
    <Description>
Heihaci one of the strongest characters of the tekken 8  has many moves which are hard to perform, using this macro on keyran, you can simply easily use it. Just select &lt;&lt;While holding key&gt;&gt; for less likely chances to fail the hit and recover quickly!  This does ENOURMOUS damage especially when you combo it with heihachi at wall as a wall ender!


Use default key binds. 

Goodluck!</Description>
    <Comment>Enjoy :)</Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 7 1
Delay 30 ms
KeyUp 7 1
Delay 30 ms
KeyDown 22 1
Delay 17 ms
KeyDown 7 1
Delay 17 ms
KeyDown 14 1
Delay 17 ms
KeyUp 14 1
KeyUp 7 1
KeyUp 22 1
Delay 17 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Tekken 8</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>